<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Feb CPI inflation rises to 19 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Feb CPI inflation rises to 19 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index rose 5.4 percent in February from January, bringing the year-on-year rate to 19 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    Feb 1997    Jan 1997    Feb 1996</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +19.0	 +15.8	 +26.4</p>
<p>All-items index		 462.6	 438.9	 388.7</p>
<p>Food-only index		 649.1	 576.3	 547.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
